# What must not travel to Vercel.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# `vercel --prod` failed on 2026-09-07 with "File size limit exceeded (100 MB)"
# after uploading 322 MB. The offender was `scripts/tmp/digital-editions/`,
# the staging directory `build-digital-editions.mjs` writes into: Codex
# Bestiarium's master is 109 MB and Vercel's per-file ceiling is 100. The
# directory is in `.gitignore`, which the CLI does not read once a
# `.vercelignore` could exist — and none did.
#
# Nothing listed here is read at build time or at runtime. The book
# repositories, the staging masters and the reports are inputs to the scripts
# that generate `public/` and the catalogue, and those outputs ARE committed.
scripts/tmp/
docs/
images/
assets/
e-book/
sub-pr-report/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
